data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Interesting findings:\n1. Button variants use scoped CSS class names (cs-component-button-10, -11, -17) instead of semantic `cs-button--primary` / `cs-button--secondary` classes. Need to figure out which class maps to primary/secondary.\n2. The Page center offset shows xOff=4.01, which might be due to Page having width 800 in a larger viewport. The Card is centered within Page, but Page itself is not centered in viewport? Actually the design says Page centers content on large screens. The x offset of 4 might be measurement precision or Page isn't centered. But DESIGN says Page component should center content on large screens.\n\nLet me investigate the design system classes. I need to inspect the actual CSS to determine which class is primary. Also I should set viewport to a known size to avoid measurement issues. Let me update the script to set viewport and determine variant by computed style (background-color).\n\nActually, for the button variant check, the simplest way is to compare the computed background-color of each button. The active primary button should have a different background from the secondary ones. But DESIGN says active colour button uses primary variant while others use secondary. I can verify this by checking which button has the \"primary\" style at any time.\n\nLet me also check if the button component uses data-variant attribute or other way to mark variant. The source code passes variant=\"primary\" / \"secondary\". The design system may transform it into scoped classes.\n\nLet me inspect the CSS to map class numbers to variants. I'll dump the button styles."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959571,"id":"chatcmpl-708419578e9e408d9fec288b7f62814e","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"node -e \\\"\\nconst puppeteer = require('puppeteer');\\n(async () =\u003e {\\n  const browser = await puppeteer.launch({ headless: true, executablePath: '/usr/bin/chromium-browser', args: ['--no-sandbox', '--disable-setuid-sandbox'] });\\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\\n  await page.setViewport({ width: 1280, height: 800 });\\n  await page.goto('http://localhost:5173/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle2' });\\n  await new Promise(r =\u003e setTimeout(r, 1000));\\n  const info = await page.$$eval('[data-component=\\\\\\\"Button\\\\\\\"]', btns =\u003e btns.map((b, i) =\u003e {\\n    const s = window.getComputedStyle(b);\\n    return {\\n      index: i,\\n      text: b.textContent.trim(),\\n      className: b.className,\\n      dataVariant: b.getAttribute('data-variant'),\\n      role: b.getAttribute('role'),\\n      tagName: b.tagName,\\n      bg: s.backgroundColor,\\n      color: s.color,\\n      borderColor: s.borderColor,\\n    };\\n  }));\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(info, null, 2));\\n  await browser.close();\\n})();\\n\\\"\", \"workdir\": \"/tmp\", \"timeout\": 120000}","name":"bash"},"id":"bash_33","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959571,"id":"chatcmpl-708419578e9e408d9fec288b7f62814e","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

